        <body>
            <div xml:id="d25">

                <pb facs="0073" n="25" sameAs="frus:frus1877/pg25"/>

                <head>No. 25.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Delaplaine to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1877-03-01"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 1, 1877</date>.
                        (Received March 19.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 41.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my Nos. 39 and 40, I beg to
                    advise my receipt this morning of a note from his excellency Count Andrássy,
                    wherein I am informed that His Imperial and Royal Majesty has graciously been
                    pleased to consent that his ambassador in London should undertake the duty of
                    selecting a gentleman to act as third commissioner under the twenty-third
                    article of the treaty of Washington of 8th May, 1871, and that Count Beust has
                    been accordingly instructed by his excellency the imperial-royal minister for
                    foreign affairs.</p>
                <p>His Imperial and Royal Majesty’s ambassador has been further instructed, after
                    having made the selection, to communicate forthwith the same to the foreign
                    office in London, and to the representative of the United States at that
                    court.</p>
                <p>I herewith append a copy of my note to Count Andrássy, and his excellency’s
                    reply, together with translation.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>J. F. DELAPLAINE.</signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d25-a1.xml" xpointer="d25-a1"/>
